context": "同样作为局部化位置的元素乘积。"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "提供序列正合性引理的章节标题。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "应用该引理所取的模。"}, {"source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素", "context": "应用该引理所取的各元素。"}, {"source_term": "sequence", "target_term": "序列", "context": "由引理判定为正合的序列。"}, {"source_term": "exact", "target_term": "正合", "context": "由引理推出的序列性质。"}, {"source_term": "standard opens", "target_term": "标准开集", "context": "此处所得层所用的开集。"}, {"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "基", "context": "此处所得层的定义域。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "满足基上层条件的对象。"}, {"source_term": "Sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "提供延拓结果的章节标题。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of rings", "target_term": "环层", "context": "与标准开集上给定对象一致的唯一环层。"}, {"source_term": "standard opens", "target_term": "标准开集", "context": "在这些开集上环层与给定对象一致。"}, {"source_term": "stalks", "target_term": "茎", "context": "指前段已完成计算的各个茎。"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "提供局部环性质所用引理的章节标题。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of rings", "target_term": "环层", "context": "指出所讨论的茎属于这个环层。"}, {"source_term": "stalks", "target_term": "茎", "context": "断言其均为局部环的各个茎。"}, {"source_term": "local rings", "target_term": "局部环", "context": "环层的茎所属的环类。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "限定最后一段任取的模。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "最后一段任取的分次模。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "与基上对象一致的唯一延拓。"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "此唯一层的取值类型。"}, {"source_term": "standard opens", "target_term": "标准开集", "context": "在这些开集上模值层与给定对象一致。"}, {"source_term": "Sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "提供模值层延拓引理的章节标题。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01M6:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为分次环（graded ring）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <TEXTITOPEN_0001>结构层（structure sheaf）<MATH_0002>（所在的齐次谱（of the homogeneous spectrum）取自<MATH_0003>）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是唯一的环层（sheaf of rings）<MATH_0004>，它在标准开集（standard opens）所成的基（basis）上与<MATH_0005>一致。\n<STRUCT_0003> 局部环化空间（locally ringed space）<MATH_0006>称为<TEXTITOPEN_0002>齐次谱（homogeneous spectrum）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>（取自<MATH_0007>），记为<MATH_0008>。\n<STRUCT_0004> 层（sheaf）（由<MATH_0009>-模（modules）构成）将<MATH_0010>延拓（extending）到<MATH_0011>的所有开集（opens）上，称为层（sheaf）（由<MATH_0012>-模（modules）构成，与<MATH_0013>相伴（associated to））。这个层（sheaf）也记为<MATH_0014>。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}, {"source_term": "structure sheaf", "target_term": "结构层"}, {"source_term": "of the homogeneous spectrum", "target_term": "齐次谱"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of rings", "target_term": "环层"}, {"source_term": "standard opens", "target_term": "标准开集"}, {"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "基"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed space", "target_term": "局部环化空间"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous spectrum", "target_term": "齐次谱"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "extending", "target_term": "延拓"}, {"source_term": "opens", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "associated to", "target_term": "相伴"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环", "context": "定义齐次谱所用的环。"}, {"source_term": "structure sheaf", "target_term": "结构层", "context": "在齐次谱上由基上的环层确定的结构层。"}, {"source_term": "of the homogeneous spectrum", "target_term": "齐次谱", "context": "说明结构层所在的谱，所属关系由句法表达。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of rings", "target_term": "环层", "context": "满足所述一致性条件的唯一环层。"}, {"source_term": "standard opens", "target_term": "标准开集", "context": "构成检验一致性的基的开集。"}, {"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "基", "context": "由标准开集构成的拓扑基。"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed space", "target_term": "局部环化空间", "context": "此处定义为齐次谱的空间及其结构层。"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous spectrum", "target_term": "齐次谱", "context": "给定分次环所对应的空间。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "延拓给定对象的模层。"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "延拓所得层的取值类型。"}, {"source_term": "extending", "target_term": "延拓", "context": "将基上给定的对象延拓至全部开集。"}, {"source_term": "opens", "target_term": "开集", "context": "模层延拓后所定义的全部开集。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "给出与指定对象相伴的层这一名称。"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "相伴层的取值类型。"}, {"source_term": "associated to", "target_term": "相伴", "context": "所得模层与给定对象之间的关系。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "获得所给记号的模层。"}], "notes": []}
